        "SRC-003675",
        "SRC-003671"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Site held a Jack in the Box restaurant and a tenant-occupied single-family house; building is about 97,487 sq ft. SF YIMBY describes the residential units as apartments; city reports describe a condominium map.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003671",
        "SRC-003673"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "An earlier proposal for the site (city file PPR19-0007) had four condominiums and 45,080 sq ft of offices in four stories, designed by Hayes Group Architects, per SF YIMBY.",
